# Copy to courier.env (gitignored) and fill in. The wrapper auto-loads it
# (shared couriers/courier.env first, then this package's courier.env).
#
# Where the standalone pr-babysitter-agent engine checkout lives. The wrapper
# execs its scripts/pr-babysitter.sh and reads its logs/ for status.
# Only set this if the engine lives somewhere non-default.
#OCEAN_PR_BABYSITTER_ENGINE_DIR=/Users/ericcromartie/Documents/Development/pr-babysitter-agent

# No tokens belong in this package. GitHub auth is the engine's own `gh` CLI
# login (`gh auth status`); Codex runs under the engine's sandbox.
